# Keep every checkout byte-identical across platforms.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout with `core.autocrlf=true` rewrites every line ending
# on the way in, and each `git add` converts them back on the way out. The repository
# content stays correct, but the churn is noisy and — worse — it hides real changes
# behind whole-file diffs. This project is developed on Windows and tested on Windows
# and Linux, so the two must agree on what a file contains.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Assets. Never touch their bytes.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.svg text eol=lf
